From 553326fa707f87720748580c409c59898c7656bc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prasad Kumpatla <prasad.kumpatla@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Jul 2026 14:17:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] FROMGIT: ASoC: qcom: qdsp6: Increase Q6DSP_MAX_CLK_ID for
 LPASS LPR vote clock

Q6DSP_MAX_CLK_ID defines the upper bound of supported clock
identifiers in the qdsp6 LPASS clock driver.

Increase the maximum clock ID value to accommodate the LPASS
LPR vote clock identifier.

Signed-off-by: Prasad Kumpatla <prasad.kumpatla@oss.qualcomm.com>
Acked-by: Bartosz Golaszewski <bartosz.golaszewski@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Srinivas Kandagatla <srinivas.kandagatla@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260724141708.2212057-3-prasad.kumpatla@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Mark Brown <broonie@kernel.org>
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/qualcomm-linux/kernel/pull/1491]
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-clocks.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-clocks.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-clocks.c
index 03838582aeade..ab7d20580638b 100644
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-clocks.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-clocks.c
@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@
 #include <dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h>
 #include "q6dsp-lpass-clocks.h"
 
-#define Q6DSP_MAX_CLK_ID			104
+#define Q6DSP_MAX_CLK_ID			105
 #define Q6DSP_LPASS_CLK_ROOT_DEFAULT		0
 
 
